{"version":1,"key":"card:18","content":{"id":18,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果一个值它是有限的几个值，我们一般会将该类型标记为枚举。比如服务返回一个字段 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"auth","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它只有三种取值："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：只有管理员有权限"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：所有人都有权限"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：管理员以及部分成员有权限"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此时你可以声明一个枚举类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"enum AuthValue {\n  ADMIN = 0,\n  ALL = 1,\n  ADMIN_AND_SOME_MEMBERS = 2\n}\n\ninterface Resp {\n  auth: AuthValue;\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"09dbaa09-a8e3-4610-ad20-233083093597","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"声明枚举时，如果没有赋值，会给一个默认值，第一个值是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，后面的值依次递增，因此上述枚举声明可以不显式赋值"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"enum AuthValue {\n  ADMIN,\n  ALL,\n  ADMIN_AND_SOME_MEMBERS\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"f85a4ca0-f98d-48f1-bf62-c72aa29cadda","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当然我们可以显式赋值，不仅仅是数字，还可以是其它类型，比如状态"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"enum Status {\n  SUCCESS = 'success',\n  FAIL = 'fail'\n}\n\nconst status: Status = 'success';","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"e3b77305-d0d5-40e4-8d8b-ffc07b6d881d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果说字面量类型是对原始类型的进一步扩展（对象字面量类型的使用较少），那么枚举在某些方面则可以理解为是对对象类型的扩展。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/数据类型","TypeScript/枚举"],"createTime":1688913503337,"updateTime":1753693491847,"linkedCards":[{"id":14,"target":{"key":"card:14","type":"card","id":14},"summary":"当一个变量它只有有限取值的时候，可以使用枚举，也可以使用联合类型，那应该使用哪个呢，比如对于服务端返回的 code 码 type Code = 0 | 1; enum Code { FAIL = 0; SUCCESS = 1; } 从语义的...","tags":["TypeScript/概念辨析","TypeScript/联合类型","TypeScript/枚举"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1753693491847}}